<Slide style={{ padding: '0px' }}>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 10, background: '#0E3F8C' }} />
  <Box style={{ padding: '30px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>预测不准，调度到底会损失什么</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ padding: '20px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, height: 206 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '18px 20px', gap: 8, height: 166 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>少报：预测 &lt; 实际</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>调度按偏低的预测多开了火电机组，结果光伏发得更多。火电有最小技术出力压不下去，多余的光伏只能弃掉。</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 14px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>丢的是电量</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '18px 20px', gap: 8, height: 166 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>多报：预测 &gt; 实际</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>调度按偏高预测压减了火电，结果光伏发不出来，出现功率缺额，只能靠旋转备用、储能放电、快速启停机组临时顶上，还要吃并网考核。</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 14px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>丢的是钱，单位代价更高</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, height: 150, marginTop: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>换算成具体量级</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>十站总装机 193.6 MW。实测气象设定每个 15 分钟断面要备 4.79 MW；换预报气象是 9.43 MW，相差 4.64 MW —— 这就是「接一条站内气象站」换来的备用缺口。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>往双碳上算一笔账</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>预测越不准，调度越不敢少留备用，光伏大发时也得留一批随时能上调的火电兜底，这些机组大多时间闲置却在持续排放。精度压下去，一头省备用火电、一头少弃光。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, height: 108, marginTop: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>2.6 倍</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>甲′ 以多报为主：多报 561 万元 &gt; 少报 216 万元</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>2.0 倍</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>丙 反过来以少报为主：少报 148 万 &gt; 多报 74 万元</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1.1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>0.00%</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>整体加偏置省不下钱；换信息源省 71.4%</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 14, width: '100%', height: 82, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 24px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        这个短板我认领之后就补掉了（MAE 对称、工程成本不对称）：85 天、近 5 万白天断面对账 —— 该换的是信息源，不是调偏置。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 40, bottom: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>12 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
